618546,5566651972,5566713561,5577451717,5578038543,5578376761,5580015794,5580024701,5580039812,5580084717],"budgets":{"max_iterations":5,"propagation_seconds":120,"retention_days":14,"worker_timeout_minutes":30},"commit_author":{"id":218610,"login":"trask"},"findings":[{"body":"<!-- ccr-overview-v2 -->\n\n### \ud83d\udfe1 Changes recommended\n\nThe decoding-failure path without a failure consumer lacks an agent-backed regression.\n\n<details open>\n<summary><strong>1 open issue</strong></summary>\n\n- <picture><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\" srcset=\"https://github.githubassets.com/static/images/icons/copilot-code-review/medium-v2-dark.svg\"><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: light)\" srcset=\"https://github.githubassets.com/static/images/icons/copilot-code-review/medium-v2-light.svg\"><img src=\"https://github.githubassets.com/static/images/icons/copilot-code-review/medium-v2-light.png\" alt=\"Medium severity\" width=\"62\" height=\"18\" align=\"texttop\"></picture> [Add regression test for chunked-query decoding failure capture](https://github.com/open-telemetry/opentelemetry-java-instrumentation/pull/20703#discussion_r4320869073) \u00b7 New\n</details>\n\n<details>\n<summary><strong>3 resolved since last review</strong></summary>\n\n- <picture><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\" srcset=\"https://github.githubassets.com/static/images/icons/copilot-code-review/medium-v2-dark.svg\"><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: light)\" srcset=\"https://github.githubassets.com/static/images/icons/copilot-code-review/medium-v2-light.svg\"><img src=\"https://github.githubassets.com/static/images/icons/copilot-code-review/medium-v2-light.png\" alt=\"Medium severity\" width=\"62\" height=\"18\" align=\"texttop\"></picture> [Preserve user exceptions thrown after cancellation](https://github.com/open-telemetry/opentelemetry-java-instrumentation/pull/20703#discussion_r4310130698)\n- <picture><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\" srcset=\"https://github.githubassets.com/static/images/icons/copilot-code-review/medium-v2-dark.svg\"><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: light)\" srcset=\"https://github.githubassets.com/static/images/icons/copilot-code-review/medium-v2-light.svg\"><img src=\"https://github.githubassets.com/static/images/icons/copilot-code-review/medium-v2-light.png\" alt=\"Medium severity\" width=\"62\" height=\"18\" align=\"texttop\"></picture> [Report intentional pre-response cancellation as success](https://github.com/open-telemetry/opentelemetry-java-instrumentation/pull/20703#discussion_r4310130680)\n- <picture><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\" srcset=\"https://github.githubassets.com/static/images/icons/copilot-code-review/medium-v2-dark.svg\"><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: light)\" srcset=\"https://github.githubassets.com/static/images/icons/copilot-code-review/medium-v2-light.svg\"><img src=\"https://github.githubassets.com/static/images/icons/copilot-code-review/medium-v2-light.png\" alt=\"Medium severity\" width=\"62\" height=\"18\" align=\"texttop\"></picture> [Register and label the exception-log test profile](https://github.com/open-telemetry/opentelemetry-java-instrumentation/pull/20703#discussion_r4310130658)\n</details>\n\n<sub>Review effort: Balanced</sub>","comment_id":null,"key":"review:5580084717","kind":"body","line":null,"path":null,"review_id":5580084717},{"body":"[Testing] The new regressions do not exercise the decoding-failure path this advice adds: `FAILURE` is valid JSON containing a server-reported error, and user callback exceptions are captured separately by the wrappers. Losing this advice's failure capture could therefore go undetected. Add an agent-backed chunked-query regression in `InfluxDbQueryLifecycleTest` with an invalid query-result shape and no failure consumer. Assert exactly one ERROR span and one duration observation, both with the decoding exception's `error.type`, and include it in the latest-dependency run to cover the newer-client behavior described here.","comment_commit_id":"53e50041a419a1362b8011d52e64ad1e20c70bf1","comment_id":4320869073,"key":"inline:4320869073","kind":"inline","line":39,"original_commit_id":"53e50041a419a1362b8011d52e64ad1e20c70bf1","original_line":39,"path":"instrumentation/influxdb-2.4/javaagent/src/main/java/io/opentelemetry/javaagent/instrumentation/influxdb/v2_4/InfluxDbChunkProcessorInstrumentation.java","review_commit_id":"53e50041a419a1362b8011d52e64ad1e20c70bf1","review_id":5580084717,"review_submitted_at":"2026-10-20T02:29:07Z","root_author":{"id":175728472,"node_id":"BOT_kgDOCnlnWA","type":"Bot"},"thread_context":[{"author":{"id":175728472,"node_id":"BOT_kgDOCnlnWA","type":"Bot"},"body_hash":"6ce5770d6dd286300c852babe193356aaf4fb2a15dd14a8f2985626119fd3ecf","id":4320869073,"parent":null,"updated_at":"2026-10-20T02:29:07Z"}],"thread_id":"PRRT_kwDODJKVX86uLVXa"}],"frozen_at":1792463775,"frozen_at_iso":"2026-10-20T02:36:15Z","frozen_sha":"53e50041a419a1362b8011d52e64ad1e20c70bf1","head_ref":"copilot/split-20685-influxdb","head_repo":"open-telemetry/opentelemetry-java-instrumentation","head_repo_id":210933087,"input_mode":"direct","launch_run":{"actor_id":218610,"attempt":1,"id":39354610141},"loop_kind":"copilot_review","metadata":{"body":"<!--\nCHANGELOG.md is generated from merged pull requests. Do not add an entry unless this PR introduces\na deprecation or breaking change.\n-->\n\nSplits the InfluxDB changes from #20685, correcting query outcomes and duration timing without changing other integrations.\n\n- **Error classification:** Classify HTTP-200 top-level and per-statement errors with bounded `error.type`, never raw error text. Retain available HTTP error codes.\n- **Terminal completion:** End asynchronous and chunked operations exactly once after callbacks and chunk processing finish, retaining callback, transport, and decoding failures, including newer-client decoding failures without a failure consumer.\n- **Cancellation and compatibility:** Make the call available before failure consumers run so pre-response cancellation remains successful. Preserve `DONE` handling, callback parent context, and supported 2.4 APIs.\n- **Regression coverage:** Cover synchronous response errors, one asynchronous statement error, successful and failed chunked completion, cancellation before and after response delivery, callback failures after cancellation, and a single 2.4 statement-error case, with span and duration-metric assertions. Retain HTTP `400` assertions in the existing failing-query integration test.","title":"Fix InfluxDB query error classification and async completion"},"mode":"publish","pr":20703,"pr_author_id":198982749,"protocol":"git-candidate-v1","publication":{"auth_mode":"fine_grained_pat","authorized_actor_id":218610,"authorized_at":1792460358,"generation":3,"max_pipelines":5,"phase":"44382849f2044ea28662de1b63641935","profile":"git-candidate-v1","required_checks":[]},"repo":"open-telemetry/opentelemetry-java-instrumentation","repo_id":210933087,"request_id":"d85b28c43ed64af5a6a20882f29d0e35","schema":2,"source_private":false,"target_private":false,"workflow_ref":"review-loop-revisions/1cc5e4db6ba59d691172ae66fe4a7ff3b0d1300b","workflow_revision":"1cc5e4db6ba59d691172ae66fe4a7ff3b0d1300b"},"run":{"attempt":1,"conclusion":"success","id":39359932564,"url":"https://github.com/trask/copilot-workflows/actions/runs/39359932564"},"schema":2,"seen_findings":["a328bd7b6e6c61e78249517f7c7ecf70448384a7bc84b9a38626e7099cef1d18","ba399cd50d4866adb07072f29b61398f3d6e5dde968bc184347f0cd7dfcbe6f3"],"seen_inline_findings":["7c5122d3b2229cd34df3aaf808a9053883df8ddb34323549198eab8aa12d3f57","d5a26510e003d7cd6bb300f7271ea5a26dafe665bbba56a8b31d0861c1b074cf","f23b61aef93fd3117ffae2febccc498e0382de3fe6dc271d080a6e61675d5f0a","3e32339eb44fd53c4286b907aca8d9f003c39de16d6c00a69ffe24cae710b032"],"seen_missed_findings":[],"stage":"verify_pending"}